<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Inland Steel upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Inland Steel upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Inland Steel Industries Inc to neutral from underperform.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for details.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 5/8 at 19.</p>
</text>
